    "backstory": "Born and bred in the digital junkyard of Jxrd's Cracker Box, Glitch spent his early days scavenging for scraps of code and broken controllers. Years of exposure to the dying blockchain have rotted his flesh, but sharpened his mind into a calculating survivalist.",
